			"notes": "# Changes\n- Nicks now support spaces\n- The rainbow in nicks has been changed from &r to &&z, this is so it doesn't conflict with Minecraft's reset or with sba's chroma\n- Icons have all been revamped by Strebbypatty and YBP_IceFox\n- You can now set maximum volume in proximity voice chat (untested)\n- Proximity voice chat now updates 1 person every 5 ticks, the person chosen is the one with the largest volume difference (untested)\n- Proximity voice chat now has an icon next to the name when someone is talking (semi-untested)\n- Size of the microphone can now be edited in /hycord overlay by using the scrollwheel\n\n# Bug fixes\n- Fixed log spam when discord isn't found\n- Fixed a rare crash\n- Fixed tnt games not always showing the tnt games picture\n- Fixed proximity voice chat not detecting server because Hypixel changed stuff"
		},
