			"notes": "# Rich Presence editing!\nYou can now edit your rich presence to your liking, you can do this individually for 3 things:\n- Skyblock\n- Lobbies\n- Other (games)\n\n**The variables that are available are:**\n- {game}: display the game you're currently playing\n- {mode}: display the mode of the game\n- {map}: display the map\n- {user}: display your username\n- {item}: display the item held \n- {players}: display the players in the lobby\n- {coins}: display the coins in your purse\n- {bits}: display the amount of bits you have\n- {time}: display the skyblock time\n- {date}: display the skyblock date\n\n# Other changes\n- made the rich presence display the correct image in arcade games and tnt games\n- fixed a crash while in a voice chat"
		}
